  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 3302.17 Module",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 3302.17 “Module” means a 3 dimensional volumetric building element which makes up a major portion of a manufactured building. It is closed construction and generally contains finished or nearly finished habitable or non-habitable space.\n\nSource. #9752, eff 7-9-10; ss by #9752, eff 7-9-10; ss by #12737, eff 3-8-19",
